  "description": "MOTCUV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 Dy4 N10 O24 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),3.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.505-3.852 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.44-110.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)2(HL)2(NO3)2(OH)2](NO3)2·4H2O (C88H100Dy4N12O33.96). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
